  "Description": {
    "Cost": 2958000,
    "UIName": "Purifier Adaptive",
    "Id": "chassisdef_purifier_adaptive_PUA-PPC_Sqd6",
    "Name": "Purifier Adaptive",
    "Details": "The Purifier Adaptive battle armor is produced by Word of Blake, though the original data was stolen from ComStar. The Purifier Adaptive is revolutionary in that it uses mimetic, color-shifting armor. The Mimetic Armor makes the Purifier Adaptive much more difficult to target, especially when it is motionless. The drawback comes in the amount of armor it carries.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Accurate</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.872</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#2aad3b>Can mount Omni units, can melee, can swarm.</b></color>",
